{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SETTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/extras/3b61027fcc6072025bb0932558833c0b.poster.avif?t=1767801795\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/extras/3b61027fcc6072025bb0932558833c0b.webm?t=1767801795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/extras/3b61027fcc6072025bb0932558833c0b.mp4?t=1767801795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are rookie agent <strong>Doug Barker</strong>, and you have just started working for <strong>P.A.W</strong>. (Paranormal Agency Worldwide).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An anonymous distress signal has been sent from the <strong>L.R.S. Great White</strong>, a mysterious research station <strong>on rails</strong> in Antarctica owned by the secretive corporation <strong>SHARK</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the help of your navigator back at HQ, make your way through the train and stop the interdimensional horrors that <strong>SHARK</strong> unleashed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But remember to keep it running! If it stops, you might freeze to death or risk being overwhelmed by horrifying monsters\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/extras/2b48e8f6c53e1ac936bbad93031d9d30.poster.avif?t=1767801795\" width=780 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/extras/2b48e8f6c53e1ac936bbad93031d9d30.webm?t=1767801795\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/extras/2b48e8f6c53e1ac936bbad93031d9d30.mp4?t=1767801795\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your way through the locomotive research station by solving puzzles and unlocking new areas while fighting back frost zombies and monsters! <strong>WHATEVER YOU DO, DON'T LET THE TRAIN STOP!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a high-speed locomotive as it tears through the Antarctic ice cap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Monitor</strong> the train\u2019s equipment as it deteriorates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Repair</strong> minor malfunctions before they become major.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jack into</strong> encrypted terminals and interface with the train\u2019s systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive</strong> the cold and <strong>fight</strong> off the horrifying creatures that lurk outside.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense gore</strong> and a <strong>gorgeous mid-2000s-inspired aesthetic</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meaningful and tactical <strong>inventory management</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>volatile combat ecosystem</strong> in which enemy behaviors intertwine, allowing them to support or sabotage one another.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>chilling story</strong> that doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132890/extras/3a4cec9347daaa48d7a8f696191148ca.avif?t=1767801795\" width=900 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_